# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# The pipeline runs on Linux runners and the workflow files contain shell.
# Without this, committing from Windows stores CRLF, and a `run:` block with
# CRLF line endings fails on a GitHub runner with errors that point at the
# script's contents rather than at its line endings — which is a bad hour.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
